{
  "id": "c1-e20-innovation-at-work",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Innovation at work",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how creative do you consider yourself to be?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think new ideas come more easily when working alone or with others?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what is the most useful invention in your daily life?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you deal with problems that have no obvious solution?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e20-a1",
            "c1-e20-a2",
            "c1-e20-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people coming up with ideas. Choose two of the pictures and say what helps these people to be creative, and what obstacles they might meet.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these environments would help you think more creatively?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e20-b1",
            "c1-e20-b2",
            "c1-e20-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people creating or improving things. Choose two of the pictures and say what skills the people might need, and why their work might be important.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, what is the most creative thing you have ever done?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some factors that encourage innovation in companies, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10800
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e20-innovation-at-work",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these factors help a company to become more innovative?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7500
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e20-innovation-at-work",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would be the most effective?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about innovation and creativity at work.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent can creativity be taught?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think big companies are less innovative than small ones?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is it more important to protect inventors' ideas or to share them freely?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Why do some countries produce more inventions than others?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should schools do more to encourage original thinking?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, can a culture that fears failure ever be truly innovative?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e20-innovation-at-work/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
